WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.862
Section 5: Rome Statute of the International Criminal Court.

00:00:04.812 --> 00:00:08.650
Canada ratified the Rome Statute in 2000.

00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:19.175
Article 7 addresses Crimes Against Humanity including murder, extermination, and inhumane acts as part of a widespread or systematic attack on civilians.

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:30.412
With 76,707 state-administered MAID deaths and documented targeting of vulnerable populations, the threshold for Article 7 analysis is engaged.
